WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:02.575
(rock music)

00:00:02.575 --> 00:00:04.626
- I don't wanna give it
away, it was the butler.

00:00:04.626 --> 00:00:05.700
The butler did it.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.220
- Leave my books alone, okay?

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.450
Just let me read.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.283
- Timber.

00:00:10.707 --> 00:00:13.170
(rock music)

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.460
- What brings you across the pond?

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.390
- It's my honeymoon.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.320
- Where's your husband?

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.203
- Dead.

00:00:17.203 --> 00:00:18.387
(Nick snoring)

00:00:18.387 --> 00:00:19.300
- Asleep!

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.982
He's dead, dead asleep.

00:00:20.982 --> 00:00:21.815
(both laughing)

00:00:21.815 --> 00:00:23.250
- Sir, if you don't return to your seat,

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.310
I'm gonna have to call--

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:25.143
- The cops.

00:00:25.143 --> 00:00:26.940
- Hey, hi honey.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.840
We've actually been married for 15 years,

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.534
but we've just been very,
very, very, very busy.

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:33.367
(Nick brushing teeth)

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:34.200
- I'm flossing.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.050
- I can see that.

00:00:36.266 --> 00:00:37.554
You're doin' it extra hard tonight.

00:00:37.554 --> 00:00:39.830
(rock music)

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.430
- Charles is inviting us to
spend the weekend with him

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:43.263
on a yacht.

00:00:43.263 --> 00:00:46.380
- Crashing the party with civilians.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.300
- You're an actress, right?

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.133
- Grace Ballard.

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:51.130
- (laughing) I an Nick Spitz!

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:52.742
This is my wife, Allison!

00:00:52.742 --> 00:00:54.002
I can't believe--

00:00:54.002 --> 00:00:55.230
- Audrey.

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:58.353
I'm Audrey.
- I said Audrey!

00:00:58.353 --> 00:01:00.420
Did ya ever fool around on a boat?

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:02.591
I just lay here and the
boat does all the work.

00:01:02.591 --> 00:01:03.424
(Audrey gasping)

00:01:03.424 --> 00:01:04.655
(women screaming)

00:01:04.655 --> 00:01:07.620
- [Man] There's been a murder!

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.453
- Should we pull it out?

00:01:08.453 --> 00:01:09.427
- No, it's a foot long knife.

00:01:09.427 --> 00:01:10.727
(knife gets pulled out of body)

00:01:10.727 --> 00:01:11.560
(crowd screaming)

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:12.393
- Will you listen to my husband?

00:01:12.393 --> 00:01:13.226
He's a detective!

00:01:13.226 --> 00:01:14.770
- I'll put it back.
- Don't put it back.

00:01:16.279 --> 00:01:17.142
- No!

00:01:17.142 --> 00:01:18.294
(Audrey screams)

00:01:18.294 --> 00:01:20.200
(police sirens sounding)

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.819
- My name is Inspector
Laurent de la Croix,

00:01:22.819 --> 00:01:25.095
and we now summon you for questioning.

00:01:25.095 --> 00:01:26.710
(puffs smoke out)

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:28.350
- Why is that smoke ring so good?

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.130
How did he do that?

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:32.360
- Did you notice anything
out of the ordinary?

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.048
- [All] The Americans.

00:01:34.048 --> 00:01:35.030
- But we didn't do this.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.005
- [Nick] Someone's trying to frame us.

00:01:37.005 --> 00:01:39.430
- We do things together, so can we please

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:40.337
just figure this out?

00:01:40.337 --> 00:01:41.170
(gun fires)

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:42.003
(Audrey screams)

00:01:42.003 --> 00:01:42.836
- [Audrey] It's just like
"Death in the Library".

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.810
- [Nick] What happens in
"Death in the Library"?

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:45.790
- They died.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:46.889
That's why it's called
"Death in the Library".

00:01:46.889 --> 00:01:47.722
(gun fires)

00:01:47.722 --> 00:01:48.863
(Audrey screams)

00:01:48.863 --> 00:01:50.644
("Look What You Made Me
Do", by Taylor Swift)

00:01:50.644 --> 00:01:51.660
♪ Look what you made me do ♪

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.200
- You guys are all over the news.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.350
They say you killed someone.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:55.510
- Do you think that's possible?

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:56.343
- We're trying.

00:01:57.244 --> 00:02:00.125
(gun fires four times)

00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:00.958
- Shoot at him!

00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:03.211
- Those were warning shots, honey!

00:02:03.211 --> 00:02:04.454
♪ But I got smarter ♪

00:02:04.454 --> 00:02:06.777
- If we're gonna do this,
we gotta look confident.

00:02:06.777 --> 00:02:10.141
♪ And me I rise up from the
dead, I do it all the time. ♪

00:02:10.141 --> 00:02:11.132
- Boom.

00:02:11.132 --> 00:02:11.965
- [Audrey] Go, go, go!

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:12.798
(gun fires)

00:02:12.798 --> 00:02:13.631
(police car crashes through plane)

00:02:13.631 --> 00:02:14.464
- Ferrari!
- What?

00:02:14.464 --> 00:02:15.297
- Testarossa!

00:02:15.297 --> 00:02:16.130
Magnum, P.I., I've got the mustache!

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:17.096
- Okay, go!

00:02:17.096 --> 00:02:17.929
- It's a fantasy!

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:19.000
(doors slam shut)

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.146
What the?

00:02:20.146 --> 00:02:21.986
Are you kidding me?
- I'm so sorry,

00:02:21.986 --> 00:02:23.562
I don't know what to say!
- Ah, go, go!

00:02:23.562 --> 00:02:25.728
(engine revs)

00:02:25.728 --> 00:02:27.666
♪ Ooh, look what you made me do ♪

00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:30.067
- You have any idea how gorgeous you look?

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:31.174
(Audrey screaming)

00:02:31.174 --> 00:02:32.770
- Hit the brakes!

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:33.870
(police car crashes)

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.269
- I love you, that was sweet.

00:02:35.269 --> 00:02:39.269
♪ Look what you just made me do ♪

